      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/TheManilaTimes/status/2056760420837593186",
      "text": "Teenage Gunmen Open Fire on San Diego Mosque, Killing 3 Men\n\nTwo teenage shooters opened fire at a San Diego mosque in San Diego, California, killing three men. The suspects then killed themselves a few blocks away. One of the suspects was 17 years old, the other was 18. The police are investigating the incident as a hate crime. They declined to give more details.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/4f2hmxqnN2\n\nCheck out our Streaming Channel: https://t.co/C9pb2oUqsR\nSubscribe to The Manila Times Channel - https://t.co/dnIlGq579i\nVisit our website at [https://t.co/NebgFHLGkL](https://t.co/RplgWtNnmJ)\n\nFollow us:\nFacebook - https://t.co/LCBdzE1vIQ\nInstagram - https://t.co/N3JioB39Hw\nTwitter - https://t.co/nvT2NBCS2Q\nDailyMotion - https://t.co/kQLkW05z92\n\nSubscribe to our Digital Edition - https://t.co/Yjf4EcoNEs\n\nCheck out our Podcasts:\nSpotify - https://t.co/F7oU0t7pqA\nApple Podcasts - https://t.co/Oo9OiYU9YI\nAmazon Music - https://t.co/ETZdbhjAo6\nDeezer: https://t.co/9uTehVPhDE\nTune In: https://t.co/AKLaZn35pJ\nStay tuned for more updates throughout the day, and remember to stay safe, stay informed, and stay connected.",
